    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlamulwa kwa batongeeji ba Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Moyo ūnibūūcha ūnitwala kū mita gwa numba ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūyo gūlolelile kīya. A ha wingīlīlo bo kūja a ha mita baalīho banhū makūmi abīlī na batanò, nūmona moi na Yazania ng'witūnja o ng'wa Azuli, na Pelatia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Benaya, abo baalī basugi ba banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, a banhū benaba hū bene abo bakabeejaga long'we jabūbi na kūfunya būganikīji bo nyakenaagūji ū mu nzengo gwenūyū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakahayaga, ‘Ī gīsī ī likanza lya kūzenga numba lītaalī dūhū ū kūshika? Ū nzengo gwenūyū gwene isabiga, a bise tūlī nyama jikūzugagwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū bahangīlage, bebe ng'wana wa munhū bahangīlage.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūnizīīla ūniwīla alīhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, H'ūmo mukūhayīlaga a bing'we banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli; alīyo ū nene namanile īyo īkwibisanyaga ū mu maganiko ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo ng'wababūlaga ū mu nzengo gwenūyū bingī no, a mapanda gaamo ng'wagookaja mibimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ī mibimba īyo ng'wīponangīja moi h'ī nyama, hama ū nzengo gwenūyū h'ī lisabiga, alīyo a bing'we nakūmupeeja ng'wīnge moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlūgū mubogohile, alīyo ū nene hū nakūng'wenhela ū būlūgū; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūmufunya ū mu nzengo gwenūyo namutūūle mu makono ga banhū ba kūle, namugwisīje nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūmalwa būlūgū nakūmutwala kū mbīmbī ja sī ya Isilaeli nakamulamulīle nsango kwenūko. Hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nzengo gwenūyū gūtūbiza isabiga ū kū bing'we, nūūlū a bing'we mutūbiza nyama ū mu gatī yaago; nakūmutwala kū mbīmbī ja sī ya Isilaeli nakamulamulīle nsango kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho hū mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA; nguno mulemile ū kūgalondeela a malange gane, nūūlū kūdima shilagīlo shane; alīyo mukūlondeelaga nhūngwa ja mahanga ayo gamupīndije hose hose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nalīfunya būhangi ūcha ū Pelatia ng'wana Benaya. Hūna nūgwa hasī nabundaalile, nūlīla n'ilaka lya higūlya, “Ee Seeba MULUNGU! Ūkūbūmala pye gete ū būshiigo wa Baisilaeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūnizīīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, a baana bang'wing'we, a badūgū bako, na ba mininga gamò nang'ho, a ba numba ya Isilaeli, hū bene abo banhū ba Yelusalemu bakūbahayaga gīkī, ‘A benabo balī kūle no nū SEEBA; ī sī īyī yene twinhilwe bise, ībize yise benekīlī.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baisilaeli kwisagījiwa kūshoka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū bawīlage, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ‘A benabo nūūlū īkī naabatwala kū mahanga ga kūle, nūbabbalasanya mu masī, nahene ū ng'wikanza ī liguhī īlī nalī būpeelelo wabo ū kū sī ījo baaja.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nakūmubilinga kūfuma ū kū mahanga, nang'wīnje ū kū sī ījo ng'wasambaalīla, nang'winhe hangī ī sī ya Isilaeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būshoka bakūshīnja mo pyī ī shigīmbo sha malofu nī shiikolile sha kūlamiwa ī sh'ipelanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma nakūbinha ng'holò ya būmò, nūbatūūlīla na moyo mpya; nakūbīngīja ī ng'holò ī ndaamu gīt'iwe, nabinhe ng'holò ya nofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūdūla kūgalondeela a malange gane, nī shilagīlo shane kūshidima mu kwilang'hana. Bakūbiza banhū bane, nū nene nūbiza Mulungu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abo ng'holò jabo jidaamīīlile mashigīmbo gabo ga malofu na mashiikolile g'ipelanya ga kūlamiwa, nakūbagwisīja nsango kūlwa shītīle shabo; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Makelubi gūūgoloola a manana gago na a madandali gaalī galī hamò nago; ī likūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli nalyo lyalī a higūlya yaago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyūgwīngīla ū nzengo, lyūkinunga kū lūgūlū, kīya ya nzengo, lyūkalembeela kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Moyo ūnibūūcha higūlya mu koolekegeje ka ng'wa Moyo o ng'wa Mulungu, ūnitwala kū basaamiwa abo baalī Babuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī shakoolechiwa īsho naalī naashibona shūnīngīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basaamiwa nūbawīla pyī īyo SEEBA walī wanolekeja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
